{"id": 2764, "title": "Spend 90% of the Time Considering Failure", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK4"], "slug": "spend-90-of-the-time-considering-failure", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/2764_spend-90-of-the-time-considering-failure.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["李嘉诚是著名的华人富豪，有记者采访李嘉诚：”大家都很好奇，您在半个多世纪的时间里，是怎么做到把事业扩张到世界各地，又能做到万无一失的呢？", "李嘉诚回答：”我往往会花90%的时间考虑失败。”接着他解释道：”我不停地研究每个项目可能出现的问题。这就和船在离开港口之前，一定要想到万一遇到台风应该如何应付一样。”", "记者问：”一般人满脑子都在想怎么成功，您为什么要花90%的时间去考虑失败呢？”", "李嘉诚沉稳地回答：”一定要先想到失败。一家公司，只要其中一个机构有了一个毛病，这个公司就有可能垮台……把各种失败考虑得越充分，成功的把握才会越大。”"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["李嘉誠是著名的華人富豪，有記者採訪李嘉誠：”大家都很好奇，您在半個多世紀的時間裡，是怎麼做到把事業擴張到世界各地，又能做到萬無一失的呢？", "李嘉誠回答：”我往往會花90%的時間考慮失敗。”接著他解釋道：”我不停地研究每個項目可能出現的問題。這就和船在離開港口之前，一定要想到萬一遇到颱風應該如何應付一樣。”", "記者問：”一般人滿腦子都在想怎麼成功，您為什麼要花90%的時間去考慮失敗呢？”", "李嘉誠沉穩地回答：”一定要先想到失敗。一家公司，只要其中一個機構有了一個毛病，這個公司就有可能垮臺……把各種失敗考慮得越充分，成功的把握才會越大。”"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["Lǐ Jiā chéng shì zhù míng de Huá rén fù háo， yǒu jì zhě cǎi fǎng Lǐ Jiā chéng：” dà jiā dōu hěn hào qí， nín zài bàn gè duō shì jì de shí jiān lǐ， shì zěn me zuò dào bǎ shì yè kuò zhāng dào shì jiè gè dì， yòu néng zuò dào wàn wú yī shī de ne？", "Lǐ Jiā chéng huí dá：” wǒ wǎng wǎng huì huā 90% de shí jiān kǎo lǜ shī bài。” jiē zhe tā jiě shì dào：” wǒ bù tíng de yán jiū měi gè xiàng mù kě néng chū xiàn de wèn tí。 zhè jiù hé chuán zài lí kāi gǎng kǒu zhī qián， yī dìng yào xiǎng dào wàn yī yù dào tái fēng yīng gāi rú hé yìng fu yī yàng。”", "jì zhě wèn：” yī bān rén mǎn nǎo zi dōu zài xiǎng zěn me chéng gōng， nín wèi shén me yào huā 90% de shí jiān qù kǎo lǜ shī bài ne？”", "Lǐ Jiā chéng chén wěn de huí dá：” yī dìng yào xiān xiǎng dào shī bài。 yī jiā gōng sī， zhǐ yào qí zhōng yī gè jī gòu yǒu le yī gè máo bìng， zhè gè gōng sī jiù yǒu kě néng kuǎ tái …… bǎ gè zhǒng shī bài kǎo lǜ de yuè chōng fèn， chéng gōng de bǎ wò cái huì yuè dà。”"], "english_paragraphs": ["Li Ka-shing is a famous Chinese business magnate. A reporter once asked him, “People are curious: over more than half a century, how have you managed to expand your business around the world while avoiding major setbacks?”", "Li replied, “I often spend 90% of my time thinking about failure.” He went on to explain, “I constantly examine the problems that might arise in each project. It’s like a ship preparing to leave port: it must plan how to cope if it encounters a typhoon.”", "The reporter asked, “Most people are focused on how to succeed. Why do you spend 90% of your time thinking about failure?”", "Li answered calmly, “You must think about failure first. If even one part of a company develops a problem, the whole company could collapse... The more thoroughly you consider every possible failure, the greater your chances of success.”"], "english_full": "Li Ka-shing is a famous Chinese business magnate. A reporter once asked him, “People are curious: over more than half a century, how have you managed to expand your business around the world while avoiding major setbacks?”\n\nLi replied, “I often spend 90% of my time thinking about failure.” He went on to explain, “I constantly examine the problems that might arise in each project. It’s like a ship preparing to leave port: it must plan how to cope if it encounters a typhoon.”\n\nThe reporter asked, “Most people are focused on how to succeed. Why do you spend 90% of your time thinking about failure?”\n\nLi answered calmly, “You must think about failure first. If even one part of a company develops a problem, the whole company could collapse... The more thoroughly you consider every possible failure, the greater your chances of success.”", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Lǐ Jiā chéng\" data-defn=\"Sir Li Ka-shing (1928-), Hong Kong businessman\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">李嘉诚</span><span class=\"tr\">李嘉誠</span><rt>Lǐ Jiā chéng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhù míng\" data-defn=\"famous / noted / well-known / celebrated\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">著名</span><span class=\"tr\">著名</span><rt>zhù míng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Huá rén\" data-defn=\"ethnic Chinese person or people\" data-hsk=\"HSK 7-9\"><span class=\"si\">华人</span><span class=\"tr\">華人</span><rt>Huá rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fù háo\" data-defn=\"rich and powerful person\" data-hsk=\"HSK 7-9\"><span class=\"si\">富豪</span><span class=\"tr\">富豪</span><rt>fù háo</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jì zhě\" data-defn=\"reporter; journalist\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">记者</span><span class=\"tr\">記者</span><rt>jì zhě</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cǎi fǎng\" data-defn=\"to interview / to gather news / to hunt for and collect / to cover\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">采访</span><span class=\"tr\">採訪</span><rt>cǎi fǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Lǐ Jiā chéng\" data-defn=\"Sir Li Ka-shing (1928-), Hong Kong businessman\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">李嘉诚</span><span class=\"tr\">李嘉誠</span><rt>Lǐ Jiā chéng</rt></ruby>：”<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dà jiā\" data-defn=\"everyone\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">大家</span><span class=\"tr\">大家</span><rt>dà jiā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dōu\" data-defn=\"all; both; entirely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-