s=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"huì\" data-defn=\"to be likely to; to be sure to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"huā\" data-defn=\"to spend (money, time)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3;4\"><span class=\"si\">花</span><span class=\"tr\">花</span><rt>huā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">9</span><span class=\"tr\">9</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">0</span><span class=\"tr\">0</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">%</span><span class=\"tr\">%</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shí jiān\" data-defn=\"time\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">时间</span><span class=\"tr\">時間</span><rt>shí jiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kǎo lǜ\" data-defn=\"to think over / to consider\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">考虑</span><span class=\"tr\">考慮</span><rt>kǎo lǜ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shī bài\" data-defn=\"failure / defeat\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">失败</span><span class=\"tr\">失敗</span><rt>shī bài</rt></ruby>。”<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiē zhe\" data-defn=\"then / after that / subsequently / in turn / in one&#x27;s turn\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">接着</span><span class=\"tr\">接著</span><rt>jiē zhe</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiě shì\" dat